TI  - Do Models Explain Themselves? Counterfactual Simulatability of Natural Language Explanations
AU  - Chen, Yanda
AU  - Zhong, Ruiqi
AU  - Ri, Narutatsu
AU  - Zhao, Chen
AU  - He, He
AU  - Steinhardt, Jacob
