TI  - Hermes: An Evidence-Driven Agentic Framework for Trustworthy and Explainable AI-Generated Video Detection
AU  - Shuaibo Li
AU  - Pengfei HAO
AU  - Hongtao Wu
AU  - Jianfeng Dong
AU  - Ping Li
